      "value": "The only way to ***animate*** the parameters of physbones at the moment seems to be by toggling the script inactive and active when making changes. Very tedious and not as fluid as expected but at least works compared to with dynamic bones. Perhaps was done for performance reasons, but official support for animateable parameters would be great",
